 مسار ليك انت لوحدك تجرب فيه. هديك اكسس ان انت تخش تقرا كل الملفات الموجودة في pharmacy اللي احنا كنا شغالين فيها في ChatGPT، وهحطلك الشات اللي بيني وبين ChatGPT كله في الفولدر بتاع المشروع بتاعنا ده. تقرا الفولدر بتاع المشروع بتاعنا هنا كله حرف حرف سطر سطر، لانه مهم كل حاجة فيه\n<truncated 939 bytes>\n2. [Artifact comment on file:///c%3A/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/implementation_plan.md]: حتي الان لا اعرف الملفات انواعها ثابتها ولا لا يعني ممكن كلهpdf وممكن كله اكسيل وممكن mix لسه معرفش الملفات ثابته ولا لا\n[Artifact comment on file:///c%3A/Users/kakak/.gemini/antigravity/brain/916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a/implementation_plan.md]: احنا بنجرب علي ملف او اتنين لحد اما نتاكد انه تمام وبعدين هجرب كأني صاحبي ارفع كل الملفات وانتظر الاكسيل النهائي \n[Artif\n<truncated 18542 bytes>\nلدوائي, حجم العبوة\\n- Spelling differences are OK (the same drug with typos)\\n- Different concentrations = different product (NOT a match)\\n- Different forms (tablets vs syrup) = different product (NOT a match)\\n- Missing info (no concentration listed) = ambiguous, not an automatic match\\n\\nUse the google.genai SDK:\\n```python\\nfrom google import genai\\nclient = genai.Client(api_key=api_key)\\nresponse = client.models.generate_content(\\n    model=model,\\n    contents=prompt,\\n    config={'response_mime_type': 'application/json'}\\n)\\n```\\n\\n## 4. src/match/coordinator.py\\nThe main coordinator that orchestrates matching across all warehouses:\\n\\n```python\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"Coordinator: matches shortages against all warehouses.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n```\\n\\nClass Coordinator:\\n- __init__(self, config: Config)\\n- process(self, shortage_items: list[dict], warehouse_data: dict[str, list[dict]]) -> dict:\\n  - warehouse_data maps warehouse_name -> list of items\\n  - For each warehouse (can think of each as a sub-agent):\\n    1. First pass: exact text matching (after normalization)\\n    2. Second pass: fuzzy matching with RapidFuzz for unmatched items\\n    3. Third pass: Gemini matching for remaining ambiguous cases\\n  - Track results per warehouse:\\n    - matched: list of (shortage_item, warehouse_item) confirmed matches\\n    - needs_review: ambiguous matches\\n  - After all warehouses processed:\\n    - Compile which shortages found in which warehouses\\n    - Identify shortages not found in any warehouse\\n  - Returns: {\\n      'warehouse_results': {name: {matched: [...], needs_review: [...]}},\\n      'not_found': [...],  # items not in any warehouse\\n      'summary': {total_shortages, matched_count, not_found_count, review_count}\\n    }\\n\\n- _match_warehouse(self, shortage_items, warehouse_items, warehouse_name) -> dict:\\n  - Process one warehouse (one sub-agent)\\n  - Print progress in Arabic\\n\\n## \n---\nThe checkpoint summary has been truncated due to hitting max length. Please see the conversation log file for the full conversation.","truncated_fields":["content"]}
