uest omits a detail and multiple catalog variants remain possible,\\nreturn review with those candidates rather than selecting one arbitrarily.\\nIf the strings plainly identify the same product and have no missing requested\\ncritical detail, match is appropriate; don't demand d\n<truncated 12924 bytes>","Description":"\"Translated to English and added exponential backoff / robust retry logic to handle rate limits\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"d:\\\\AI_Engineer\\\\Pharmacy-agy\\\\src\\\\match\\\\coordinator.py\"","toolAction":"\"Updating coordinator\"","toolSummary":"\"Coordinator backoff logic\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
