og, DO NOT return an object for that case. OMIT IT COMPLETELY from the results array.\\n\\nFor cases you do return:\\n\\\"m\\\" needs the IDs of the same product; \\\"r\\\" may identify plausible candidates. \\nNever invent a product or fill missing digits.\\n\\nPreserve brand identity, strength, concentration, dosage form and pack size.\\nExact unit conversion (1 g = 1000 mg) is allowed; changing the dose is not.\\nDifferent explicit strength, dosage form, route, release type or pack size is\\nnot a match. A requested critical detail missing from the catalog is review,\\nnot automatic agreement. A number without a clear unit must not be assigned a\\nmade-up meaning. Do not infer strip size or assume a small pack means 15 g.\\nIf the strings plainly identify the same product and have no missing requested\\ncritical detail, \\\"m\\\" is appropriate.\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n\\ndef _response_schema():\\n    return {\\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\", \\\"properties\\\": {\\\"results\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"array\\\", \\\"items\\\": {\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\", \\\"properties\\\": {\\n            \\\"cid\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\"},\\n            \\\"s\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"enum\\\": [\\\"m\\\", \\\"r\\\"]},\\n            \\\"ids\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"array\\\", \\\"items\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\"}}\\n        },\\n        \\\"required\\\": [\\\"cid\\\", \\\"s\\\", \\\"ids\\\"], \n<truncated 11988 bytes>","Description":"\"Added deduplication to shrink 993 items to 591 unique items, set batch size to 300, and increased connection timeout to 900s.\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"d:\\\\AI_Engineer\\\\Pharmacy-agy\\\\src\\\\match\\\\coordinator.py\"","toolAction":"\"Adding deduplication & extending timeout\"","toolSummary":"\"Deduplication and timeout fix\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
